+     * the GPU backend, even if its resize/reset/reconfig is pending. There
+     * is no output for redraws/repeated frames or when no frame is pending.
+     *
+     * A frame that is not backed by VideoToolbox returns UNSUPPORTED;
+     * in render() it remains queued so the caller can use its fallback.
+     * This does not start, stop, seek or reconfigure the media decoder.
