+     * PQ/HLG code values with BT.2020 primaries. With 1, OSD and subtitles are
+     * blended as plain sRGB values, for hosts that present the result as SDR.
+     * With 2, they are mapped to that HDR transfer at reference white (203
+     * nits for PQ, 75% signal for HLG), for hosts that tag the target as HDR.
+     * SDR frames are composed identically in both modes.
